    "en_us": {
      "index": "---\nflavor: \"UNLIMITED POWER!!!!!!!\"\n---\n\n# Introduction\nThe {{\"template\":\"referral\",\"description\":\"an unobtainable block\",\"plural\":false,\"of\":\"self\"}} is an unobtainable block introduced in {{\"template\":\"referral\",\"of\":\"to_base:mod_version / lcc:0.3.0\"}} and reintroduced in {{\"template\":\"referral\",\"of\":\"to_base:mod_version / to_sky_and_stars:0.1.0\"}}. It provides infinite power to adjacent machines or machines connected through {{\"of\":\"minecraft:block / to_sky_and_stars:power_cable\",\"plural\":true}}.\n"
